  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The blood of your chosen prey renews and refreshes you.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Blood Drinker<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier to the number of temporary hit points you gain, but you may forgo the normal benefits of this feat and instead gain the benefit of lesser restoration. The maximum number of temporary hit points you may have is equal to 5 temporary hit points per Hit Die you have.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-a-f-feats#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
